DTEND:20260925T203000Z
SUMMARY:LinkedIn for Career Success
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Build a LinkedIn profile that helps you stand out to employers 
 and expand your professional network. Join Career Services to learn how to
  create a strong LinkedIn presence and use the platform as a powerful tool
  for career success.\nIn this session\, you'll learn how to optimize your 
 profile\, showcase your skills and experiences\, grow your professional ne
 twork\, connect with recruiters\, and search for internships and full-time
  opportunities. You'll also discover best practices for creating a profess
 ional online presence and using LinkedIn to support your long-term career 
 goals.\nWhether you're creating your first LinkedIn profile or looking to 
 improve an existing one\, this workshop will provide practical tips and st
 rategies to help you make the most of LinkedIn throughout your career jour
 ney.\n\nRegister: https://career-asu.12twenty.com/events/30006101375220
END:VEVENT
