DTSTAMP:20260812T191450Z
DTSTART:20261113T190000Z
DTEND:20261113T203000Z
SUMMARY:Interview Skills for International Students
LOCATION:Tempe - SSV Amphitheater
DESCRIPTION:Build the confidence and skills to succeed in U.S. job intervie
 ws. Join Career Services for a workshop designed specifically for internat
 ional students to learn what employers expect and how to make a strong imp
 ression throughout the interview process.\nIn this session\, you'll learn 
 how to prepare for common interview questions\, communicate your skills an
 d experiences effectively\, answer behavioral interview questions using pr
 oven techniques\, and navigate questions related to work authorization wit
 h confidence. You'll also gain tips on professional etiquette\, virtual in
 terviews\, and strategies for showcasing the unique strengths you bring as
  an international student.\nWhether you're preparing for your first interv
 iew or looking to improve your interviewing skills\, this workshop will he
 lp you present yourself with confidence and increase your chances of landi
 ng internships and full-time opportunities.\n\n(Date/time TBD - subject to
  change)
END:VEVENT
